                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34b6ca2b-2c04-3547-9b01-79435912ea35",
                                        "entry_id": "1ff4a33a-5179-3e2a-87f6-86c236c2cade",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expression of grief, suffering, sadness or regret."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f5bd2fc-4af7-347a-a7bd-0259dca217fe",
                                        "entry_id": "1ff4a33a-5179-3e2a-87f6-86c236c2cade",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A song expressing grief."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lament",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97da2a4f-74cd-3625-acbe-f88d34c8e773",
                                        "entry_id": "c9fbf2ff-3ba7-30a6-9379-531ea8d82c1a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To express grief; to weep or wail; to mourn."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cf65efb-1b61-44a9-85f3-9919382ab3b2",
                                                "sense_id": "97da2a4f-74cd-3625-acbe-f88d34c8e773",
                                                "text": "Ye shall weep and lament, but the world shall rejoice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0320b4f2-e1ad-3837-8093-7f73d67f83ba",
                                        "entry_id": "c9fbf2ff-3ba7-30a6-9379-531ea8d82c1a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To express great sorrow or regret over; to bewail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94be9d4f-b1ce-460c-a7ce-8d0296b58dba",
                                                "sense_id": "0320b4f2-e1ad-3837-8093-7f73d67f83ba",
                                                "text": "Euston is so traditionally a part of the London scene that many will lament the passing of the old station when rebuilding is complete in readiness for the new electric service, which will probably be by multiple-units between Euston and Wolverhampton."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b54b535-ea1d-4d25-8285-eddef2c4030a",
                                                "sense_id": "0320b4f2-e1ad-3837-8093-7f73d67f83ba",
                                                "text": "By the end, Sunderland were lucky to lose by the same scoreline Northampton Town suffered against Southampton, in 1921. The Sunderland manager, Gus Poyet, lamented that it was “the most embarrassed I’ve ever been on a football pitch, without a doubt”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3b19626-4e56-4a69-bef6-deb19191f1ca",
                                                "sense_id": "0320b4f2-e1ad-3837-8093-7f73d67f83ba",
                                                "text": "One laugh'd at follies, one lamented crimes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "63c0b29f-139d-442c-844f-1c602b8211b1",
                        "source_entry_id": "d5b11853-764d-3baf-84df-d21dfb74f01c",
                        "source_sense_id": "2cfd34eb-d905-3b60-91b0-1955965460d0",
                        "target_lang_word": "lamentation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lamentation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04841860-7f74-3f9c-b330-f13f9b37b350",
                                        "entry_id": "38b8d735-9aa6-38b4-a948-921b2cb7c5ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Plainte accompagnée de gémissements et de cris."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4079d4a5-aa32-4cac-abec-3d147a4ee226",
                                                "sense_id": "04841860-7f74-3f9c-b330-f13f9b37b350",
                                                "text": "Et bien des fois, descendu dans la nuit des géhennes sociales, j’ai porté aux moribonds la résignation, l’espérance aux désespérés ; bien des fois j’ai changé en cris de joie les lamentations farouches de ces damnés."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78d85d82-6948-4759-9888-24df15c0d850",
                                                "sense_id": "04841860-7f74-3f9c-b330-f13f9b37b350",
                                                "text": "…et, au milieu du silence troublé par le seul bruissement de la brise hivernale, je crus effectivement entendre de longues plaintes qui me semblaient n'être pas seulement la lamentation du vent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f34a34e-e4b7-3897-ab8f-af2a24268d0a",
                                        "entry_id": "38b8d735-9aa6-38b4-a948-921b2cb7c5ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Expression de douleur et de regret."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7b8f346-09bc-4916-9de6-28c71cc6cba3",
                                                "sense_id": "6f34a34e-e4b7-3897-ab8f-af2a24268d0a",
                                                "text": "Sa visite fut une longue lamentation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
